                          "y"
                        ]
                      },
                      "maxItems": 4,
                      "minItems": 4
                    },
                    "cell_um": {
                      "description": "The cell: the largest rectangle, square with the stage and of the\nframe's proportions (or, the camera turned near a right angle, the\nturned frame's), that the frame holds about its centre. A grid tiles\ncells, so a region its cells cover, its frames cover.",
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
